  "label": "The man is mapped as the source delivering the joke.",
  "description": "The visual entity 'man' is mapped onto the textual entity 'text_chunk_1' (you can make jokes about anything.) as the speaker or source of the joke. The text is presented as if it is being delivered by the man, who is visually positioned as the central figure in the scene. His serious expression and the juxtaposition with the text create an analogical mapping where the man is the 'joke-deliverer' in the context of the meme's narrative.",
